DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddcc driver provides support for the Analog Devices AD7416/AD7417/7418
     temperature sensor.  The sensor possesses at least an internal tempera‐
     ture sensor.  The AD7417 and 7418 also contain 4 additional ADC convert‐
     ers.  These values are made available through the sysctl(8) interface.

